  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SONKE Core Contribution 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonke Gender Justice, through local country partners within existing structures from the MenEngage Africa (MEA) network, aims to transform masculinities to advance access and use of SRHR for women and girls, in all their diversity, in Africa under the MEA regional SRHR strategy 2023 -2027. The overall objective of the programme is that women, girls, adolescents and people with disabilities will be able to hold systems accountable and ensure access to universal health coverage for all. By late 2023 the programme has been implemented in Ethiopia, Uganda and Malawi.</narrative>
  </description>
